# 2026-11-11 19:00:42.654979
+Create the initial repository scaffolding for this project.
+
+Create ONLY these files at the repo root. Do not create source files yet.
+
+1. package.json with:
+   - "name": "codejs", "private": true, "type": "module"
+   - "engines": { "node": ">=20" }
+   - scripts: build (tsc -b), typecheck (tsc --noEmit),
+     test (vitest run), test:watch (vitest), lint (eslint .),
+     format (prettier --write .), dev (tsx watch)
+   - devDependencies: typescript ^5.5, vitest ^2, tsx ^4, eslint ^9,
+     prettier ^3, @types/node
+
+2. tsconfig.base.json with strict settings: target ES2022,
+   module NodeNext, moduleResolution NodeNext, strict true,
+   noUncheckedIndexedAccess true, noImplicitOverride true,
+   exactOptionalPropertyTypes true, verbatimModuleSyntax true,
+   esModuleInterop true, skipLibCheck true, resolveJsonModule true,
+   declaration true, sourceMap true, outDir dist, rootDir src.
+
+3. tsconfig.json at root: { "extends": "./tsconfig.base.json",
+   "files": [], "references": [] }
+
+4. .nvmrc containing "20"
+
+5. .editorconfig (2-space indent, LF, UTF-8, final newline)
+
+6. .gitignore with: node_modules/, dist/, coverage/, .env*, *.log,
+   *.sqlite, *.db, playground/
+
+7. .prettierrc with: { "semi": true, "singleQuote": true, "printWidth": 100 }
+
+8. eslint.config.cjs (ESLint 9 flat config, TypeScript parser)
+
+9. vitest.config.ts with coverage enabled
+
+10. README.md — a short project overview (5-10 lines) stating this is a
+    personal learning workspace, TypeScript by default, and pointing to
+    CONVENTIONS.md.
+
+11. LICENSE — MIT.
+
+After creating these, run `npm install` and `npx tsc --noEmit` mentally
+verify the config parses. Report what you created.

