# 2026-11-11 19:01:23.080395
+Create the source directory structure with placeholder `index.ts` files.
+Each index.ts should export nothing yet and contain a single JSDoc
+comment describing the folder's purpose.
+
+Create these directories, each with an `index.ts` and a `README.md`:
+
+- src/dsa/structures/          (data structures)
+- src/dsa/algorithms/          (algorithms)
+- src/scripts/                 (CLI scripts)
+- src/web/servers/             (http servers)
+- src/web/apps/                (web apps)
+- src/db/                      (database experiments)
+- src/network/                 (tcp/udp/ws/http)
+- src/ts/                      (typescript language experiments)
+- src/es6/                     (modern js)
+- src/es5/                     (legacy js)
+- experiments/                 (dated experiments)
+- examples/                    (polished examples)
+- docs/                        (notes)
+
+Each README.md should be 3-6 lines: what goes here and any run
+command. Do not create example implementations yet.

