# 2026-11-11 19:03:51.393767
+Create the first data structure following CONVENTIONS.md.
+
+Files:
+- src/dsa/structures/stack/stack.ts — a generic Stack<T> class with
+  push, pop, peek, isEmpty, size. Throw on pop/peek when empty.
+- src/dsa/structures/stack/stack.test.ts — Vitest tests covering
+  empty, push/pop LIFO order, peek, and error on pop from empty.
+- src/dsa/structures/stack/index.ts — re-export Stack.
+- src/dsa/structures/stack/README.md — 5 lines: what it is, complexity,
+  run command `npx vitest src/dsa/structures/stack`.
+
+Then run `npx vitest run src/dsa/structures/stack` and report the result.

