# 2026-11-11 19:04:45.116796
+Create a TypeScript language feature demo.
+
+- src/ts/generics.ts — demonstrate constrained generics, conditional
+  types, and mapped types. Include a short runnable `main()` guarded by
+  the direct-execution check.
+- src/ts/generics.test.ts — type-level sanity tests where useful, and
+  runtime assertions for a couple of exported helpers.
+- src/ts/README.md — 4 lines describing what's demonstrated.
+
+Run `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npx vitest run src/ts` and report the result.

# 2026-11-11 19:05:37.089736
+Create a UDP echo client/server example.
+
+- src/network/udp-echo/server.ts — binds UDP to 127.0.0.1:41234, echoes
+  each datagram back prefixed with "echo: ". Guard with direct-exec check.
+- src/network/udp-echo/client.ts — sends one datagram, prints reply,
+  exits.
+- src/network/udp-echo/README.md — two-line run instructions for server
+  and client in two terminals.

